    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d554">

                <pb facs="0637" n="563" xml:id="pg563"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2020</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-18T16:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 18, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>192. Your 5, June 6, 4 p.m., received June 14.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d554-f1"/>
                    Report correct except that American commander took no part, merely reporting
                    action of British and French. Navy Department is aware that this Government is
                    unprepared to recognize central Bolshevik authorities or enter into any official
                    relations with them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
